1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:36,345 --> 00:01:37,921
You little wretch.

3
00:01:37,945 --> 00:01:40,205
In such a hurry to see me?

4
00:01:46,825 --> 00:01:48,485
I never expected

5
00:01:48,745 --> 00:01:50,081
you'd still be alive.

6
00:01:50,105 --> 00:01:51,525
What?

7
00:01:52,145 --> 00:01:53,361
Come for revenge?

8
00:01:53,385 --> 00:01:55,405
Revenge is only the beginning.

9
00:01:56,865 --> 00:01:58,681
Do you remember what
you did to A-Xiang and me?

10
00:01:58,705 --> 00:01:59,801
A-Xiang?

11
00:01:59,825 --> 00:02:02,041
I'll repay you a thousandfold.

12
00:02:02,065 --> 00:02:03,805
What I did to A-Xiang...

13
00:02:04,385 --> 00:02:06,445
You know that better than anyone.

14
00:02:06,865 --> 00:02:09,201
That insignificant little bastard back then

15
00:02:09,225 --> 00:02:12,245
has grown even prettier than A-Xiang.

16
00:02:12,825 --> 00:02:15,125
-Come here.
-How dare you!

17
00:02:28,145 --> 00:02:30,681
You used to kneel and beg for mercy.

18
00:02:30,705 --> 00:02:33,525
Now you've learned to throw
your authority around.

19
00:02:34,225 --> 00:02:35,885
Didn't you come for revenge?

20
00:02:37,905 --> 00:02:39,245
The knife is right there.

21
00:02:40,425 --> 00:02:41,565
What?

22
00:02:43,265 --> 00:02:44,605
Too afraid to take it?

23
00:02:51,065 --> 00:02:52,081
Of course.

24
00:02:52,105 --> 00:02:53,925
That night, ten years ago,

25
00:02:54,945 --> 00:02:57,361
you also tried to kill me with a knife.

26
00:02:57,385 --> 00:03:00,481
Too bad I've lived another ten years.

27
00:03:00,505 --> 00:03:03,125
Your little friend wasn't so lucky.

28
00:03:03,625 --> 00:03:05,201
By now,

29
00:03:05,225 --> 00:03:09,041
she's a lonely ghost in an unmarked grave.

30
00:03:09,065 --> 00:03:11,765
What a pity when I think about it.

31
00:03:13,505 --> 00:03:15,161
The more she begged,

32
00:03:15,185 --> 00:03:16,441
the more excited I became.

33
00:03:16,465 --> 00:03:18,525
Let go of me! Let go!

34
00:03:18,945 --> 00:03:20,725
Let go of me!

35
00:03:21,145 --> 00:03:22,965
-Let go of me!
-Do it!

36
00:03:23,185 --> 00:03:26,281
I'm a law-abiding citizen now, Lao Zhai.

37
00:03:26,305 --> 00:03:27,681
And you're an imperial official.

38
00:03:27,705 --> 00:03:29,525
You can't kill me.

39
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:41,361
Ten years have passed.

40
00:03:41,385 --> 00:03:44,041
I'm no longer the beggar
you could abuse at will.

41
00:03:44,065 --> 00:03:45,801
What you owe those children

42
00:03:45,825 --> 00:03:47,245
must now be repaid.

43
00:03:56,545 --> 00:03:59,161
These are white plum blossoms
from Mount Zhongnan.

44
00:03:59,185 --> 00:04:00,321
Placed in a music house,

45
00:04:00,345 --> 00:04:02,365
they symbolize pure
notes and refined charm.

46
00:04:12,105 --> 00:04:13,365
Careful. You'll cut your hand.

47
00:04:15,345 --> 00:04:16,525
I'm truly sorry.

48
00:04:16,865 --> 00:04:19,881
I'll compensate the proprietor
at three times the market price.

49
00:04:19,905 --> 00:04:21,561
It was only an ordinary ornament.

50
00:04:21,585 --> 00:04:23,041
No need to be so courteous,
Young Master He.

51
00:04:23,065 --> 00:04:24,721
But you, Young Master He,

52
00:04:24,745 --> 00:04:27,481
have been visiting Huiyin House
quite often lately.

53
00:04:27,505 --> 00:04:30,841
I wonder whether you're
interested in music and dance,

54
00:04:30,865 --> 00:04:32,801
or in me.

55
00:04:32,825 --> 00:04:34,205
Interested in me?

56
00:04:34,785 --> 00:04:36,841
Naturally, I'm interested in you.

57
00:04:36,865 --> 00:04:39,881
I've always found you
rather mysterious, Miss Situ.

58
00:04:39,905 --> 00:04:41,521
You don't seem to be merely

59
00:04:41,545 --> 00:04:42,521
the proprietor of a music house.

60
00:04:42,545 --> 00:04:44,161
The feeling is mutual.

61
00:04:44,185 --> 00:04:46,321
I've entertained many
sons of noble families

62
00:04:46,345 --> 00:04:47,721
and consider myself a
good judge of character.

63
00:04:47,745 --> 00:04:51,041
Yet your bearing is
exceptionally distinguished,

64
00:04:51,065 --> 00:04:52,241
and your knowledge extraordinary.

65
00:04:52,265 --> 00:04:54,641
You hardly seem,
as Young Master Shen claimed,

66
00:04:54,665 --> 00:04:56,285
to be an ordinary merchant.

67
00:04:57,465 --> 00:04:58,361
Wait.

68
00:04:58,385 --> 00:05:00,761
I clearly knew Proprietor Situ first,

69
00:05:00,785 --> 00:05:02,001
yet now I can't get a word in.

70
00:05:02,025 --> 00:05:03,401
You two are getting along so well

71
00:05:03,425 --> 00:05:04,401
that you seem more like kindred spirits.

72
00:05:04,425 --> 00:05:06,401
Then I hope Miss Situ and I

73
00:05:06,425 --> 00:05:07,885
will not suddenly go

74
00:05:08,545 --> 00:05:10,121
from kindred spirits to strangers.

75
00:05:10,145 --> 00:05:13,085
I might become a stranger to anyone,

76
00:05:13,505 --> 00:05:15,205
but with you, Young Master He...

77
00:05:16,465 --> 00:05:17,885
I'd be reluctant to.

78
00:05:19,585 --> 00:05:21,281
Has His Majesty dismissed his suspicions

79
00:05:21,305 --> 00:05:22,561
and started calling her a kindred spirit?

80
00:05:22,585 --> 00:05:25,201
She's the most renowned
music-house proprietor in the capital,

81
00:05:25,225 --> 00:05:27,201
smooth and flawless in every situation.

82
00:05:27,225 --> 00:05:28,921
You actually believe what she says?

83
00:05:28,945 --> 00:05:30,325
Then why did Your Majesty...?

84
00:05:30,585 --> 00:05:32,321
I was merely playing along.

85
00:05:32,345 --> 00:05:33,521
She has no sword wound on her body.

86
00:05:33,545 --> 00:05:34,601
Yet Your Majesty still suspects her?

87
00:05:34,625 --> 00:05:36,041
After testing her today,

88
00:05:36,065 --> 00:05:37,241
I am even more certain

89
00:05:37,265 --> 00:05:38,921
that her identity is anything but ordinary.

90
00:05:38,945 --> 00:05:40,165
Zhishu,

91
00:05:40,505 --> 00:05:42,561
follow the musicians'
convoy to the frontier.

92
00:05:42,585 --> 00:05:43,961
Whatever they purchase,

93
00:05:43,985 --> 00:05:45,601
investigate every detail thoroughly.

94
00:05:45,625 --> 00:05:47,045
I obey.

95
00:05:49,425 --> 00:05:52,441
Help!

96
00:05:52,465 --> 00:05:56,041
Meng Tinghui of the Bureau of
Intelligence has killed someone!

97
00:05:56,065 --> 00:05:57,161
Someone report this to the authorities!

98
00:05:57,185 --> 00:05:59,401
Help!

99
00:05:59,425 --> 00:06:01,521
Murder!

100
00:06:01,545 --> 00:06:05,805
Lord Meng Tinghui of the
Bureau of Intelligence

101
00:06:06,105 --> 00:06:08,121
is taking a life in broad daylight!

102
00:06:08,145 --> 00:06:10,645
She treats human life as worthless!

103
00:06:11,825 --> 00:06:13,365
Please, everyone,

104
00:06:13,825 --> 00:06:15,645
save this old man!

105
00:06:34,305 --> 00:06:35,805
Lord Meng!

106
00:06:36,065 --> 00:06:38,645
Spare me, Lord Meng! Please!

107
00:06:40,185 --> 00:06:42,881
I'm only a commoner.

108
00:06:42,905 --> 00:06:46,281
I've never done anything wicked in my life!

109
00:06:46,305 --> 00:06:47,361
Lord Meng,

110
00:06:47,385 --> 00:06:49,601
I only know that back in Shazhou,

111
00:06:49,625 --> 00:06:50,921
you were a swindler and thief,

112
00:06:50,945 --> 00:06:53,001
a petty thug with blood on your hands.

113
00:06:53,025 --> 00:06:54,801
But don't worry, Lord Meng.

114
00:06:54,825 --> 00:06:57,441
Spare my life,

115
00:06:57,465 --> 00:06:58,721
and I would never dare mention

116
00:06:58,745 --> 00:07:01,761
your dark past to anyone.

117
00:07:01,785 --> 00:07:03,561
That woman is Lord Meng
of the Bureau of Intelligence.

118
00:07:03,585 --> 00:07:04,801
That's right.

119
00:07:04,825 --> 00:07:06,001
She's actually abusing

120
00:07:06,025 --> 00:07:07,241
-a crippled old man while wearing official robes.
-Please spare me!

121
00:07:07,265 --> 00:07:10,321
-Spare me! Please spare me!
-How did this old man offend her?

122
00:07:10,345 --> 00:07:11,645
Stop pretending.

123
00:07:13,745 --> 00:07:15,845
Do you think this will help you escape?

124
00:07:17,105 --> 00:07:19,005
You little wretch.

125
00:07:20,225 --> 00:07:23,401
If you've got the nerve, kill me

126
00:07:23,425 --> 00:07:24,965
in front of everyone.

127
00:07:28,265 --> 00:07:30,645
I'm a law-abiding citizen now.

128
00:07:34,865 --> 00:07:36,245
Come on, then...

129
00:07:36,545 --> 00:07:38,205
Do it!

130
00:07:45,185 --> 00:07:47,445
This... Lord Meng, she...

131
00:07:49,945 --> 00:07:51,085
Back then,

132
00:07:51,945 --> 00:07:54,205
that persecuted little beggar

133
00:07:55,305 --> 00:07:57,641
truly could do nothing to you.

134
00:07:57,665 --> 00:07:59,681
I swore that if I ever held
a blade in my hand,

135
00:07:59,705 --> 00:08:01,521
I would cut you into a thousand pieces.

136
00:08:01,545 --> 00:08:02,885
You?

137
00:08:03,265 --> 00:08:06,445
A mere beggar making empty threats?

138
00:08:07,065 --> 00:08:08,405
But today,

139
00:08:09,425 --> 00:08:11,845
I wear the robes of an imperial official

140
00:08:12,305 --> 00:08:14,445
and stand beneath the law of the realm.

141
00:08:15,225 --> 00:08:17,685
With this office and this life,

142
00:08:18,105 --> 00:08:20,481
I will personally bring you to justice.

143
00:08:20,505 --> 00:08:22,405
You dare?

144
00:08:28,305 --> 00:08:30,005
I'll kill you!

145
00:08:35,785 --> 00:08:38,325
Today is the day you die!

146
00:08:43,265 --> 00:08:45,205
Let go of me!

147
00:08:46,305 --> 00:08:48,325
I'm going to kill you!

148
00:08:49,345 --> 00:08:50,805
Save me!

149
00:08:51,545 --> 00:08:53,765
Save...

150
00:09:10,865 --> 00:09:12,485
Meng Tinghui!

151
00:09:27,945 --> 00:09:29,041
Number eighty-eight!

152
00:09:29,065 --> 00:09:31,205
-Over here!
-Welcome, honored guests. Please come inside.

153
00:09:32,425 --> 00:09:33,961
Please don't be impatient, everyone.

154
00:09:33,985 --> 00:09:35,601
We'll get to you very soon.

155
00:09:35,625 --> 00:09:37,641
Everyone, Bofeng House is full today.

156
00:09:37,665 --> 00:09:39,841
It will take another incense
stick before a table opens up.

157
00:09:39,865 --> 00:09:41,241
Guests whose numbers haven't been called

158
00:09:41,265 --> 00:09:42,641
may have a cup of ginger tea first.

159
00:09:42,665 --> 00:09:45,005
The wind is cold.
Take care not to catch a chill.

160
00:09:46,025 --> 00:09:47,281
What a ridiculous show.

161
00:09:47,305 --> 00:09:49,121
You're only acting smug
because you have court backing.

162
00:09:49,145 --> 00:09:51,361
Let's see how much longer

163
00:09:51,385 --> 00:09:52,441
you can keep hopping around
like a grasshopper in autumn.

164
00:09:52,465 --> 00:09:54,401
You couldn't hop even if you tried.

165
00:09:54,425 --> 00:09:57,281
May Bofeng House run into trouble soon.

166
00:09:57,305 --> 00:09:59,485
Shopkeeper!

167
00:10:00,425 --> 00:10:01,481
Shopkeeper!

168
00:10:01,505 --> 00:10:03,321
Shopkeeper, I saw Lord Meng...

169
00:10:03,345 --> 00:10:05,645
-What happened to Mengmeng?
-Lord Meng killed someone!

170
00:10:07,825 --> 00:10:10,281
-Watch the shop.
-So she finally killed someone.

171
00:10:10,305 --> 00:10:12,405
I told you she wouldn't last much longer.

172
00:10:29,025 --> 00:10:30,165
Miss Yan.

173
00:10:30,745 --> 00:10:32,205
Young Lord Shen.

174
00:10:34,585 --> 00:10:36,041
Where are you going, Miss Yan?

175
00:10:36,065 --> 00:10:37,321
I'm going to the Bureau of Intelligence.

176
00:10:37,345 --> 00:10:38,561
They said Mengmeng killed someone.

177
00:10:38,585 --> 00:10:39,841
His Majesty witnessed it himself.

178
00:10:39,865 --> 00:10:40,921
Lord Meng has already
been taken into the palace.

179
00:10:40,945 --> 00:10:43,321
Mengmeng would never
kill an innocent person.

180
00:10:43,345 --> 00:10:45,281
She must have had a reason.

181
00:10:45,305 --> 00:10:47,085
Then I'll go to the palace to find her.

182
00:10:48,545 --> 00:10:49,441
Without His Majesty's summons,

183
00:10:49,465 --> 00:10:50,561
no one can enter.

184
00:10:50,585 --> 00:10:51,681
Then I won't go in.

185
00:10:51,705 --> 00:10:53,765
I'll wait for her at the palace gate.

186
00:10:54,945 --> 00:10:56,481
-I'll take you.
-Young Lord Shen,

187
00:10:56,505 --> 00:10:58,121
we still have important business.
We cannot delay.

188
00:10:58,145 --> 00:10:59,961
You go ahead.
My horse is fast. I'll catch up later.

189
00:10:59,985 --> 00:11:01,881
Young Lord Shen,
the snow is falling hard and fast.

190
00:11:01,905 --> 00:11:03,321
It is far too dangerous

191
00:11:03,345 --> 00:11:05,041
for you to ride alone.

192
00:11:05,065 --> 00:11:06,885
Forget it. I'll find another way.

193
00:11:08,585 --> 00:11:09,481
Do as I say.

194
00:11:09,505 --> 00:11:10,645
Yes.

195
00:11:13,865 --> 00:11:15,005
Mount up.

196
00:11:39,425 --> 00:11:40,321
Your Majesty.

197
00:11:40,345 --> 00:11:41,641
The Ministry of Revenue has confirmed

198
00:11:41,665 --> 00:11:43,001
that the man's name is Lao Zhai.

199
00:11:43,025 --> 00:11:45,281
He is nearly fifty and has a lame leg.

200
00:11:45,305 --> 00:11:46,321
Though his family is poor,

201
00:11:46,345 --> 00:11:47,881
he has never broken the law.

202
00:11:47,905 --> 00:11:50,281
Meng Tinghui killed an innocent man.

203
00:11:50,305 --> 00:11:51,641
Her crime merits death.

204
00:11:51,665 --> 00:11:54,405
Everyone I killed deserved to die.

205
00:11:54,705 --> 00:11:55,841
Lao Zhai was no law-abiding citizen.

206
00:11:55,865 --> 00:11:58,161
He was a human trafficker
with countless crimes.

207
00:11:58,185 --> 00:11:59,081
Master Wen.

208
00:11:59,105 --> 00:12:00,841
Utter nonsense, Your Majesty.

209
00:12:00,865 --> 00:12:03,201
Lao Zhai's household registration
and his neighbors' testimony

210
00:12:03,225 --> 00:12:04,881
are enough to prove his innocence.

211
00:12:04,905 --> 00:12:06,365
If he was innocent,

212
00:12:07,305 --> 00:12:09,085
then no one in this world is innocent.

213
00:12:13,185 --> 00:12:15,805
-Summon Lao Zhai.
-Bring Lao Zhai in.

214
00:12:34,865 --> 00:12:36,361
This commoner, Lao Zhai,

215
00:12:36,385 --> 00:12:38,121
greets Your Majesty.

216
00:12:38,145 --> 00:12:39,725
Raise your head.

217
00:12:42,585 --> 00:12:44,281
What grievance exists

218
00:12:44,305 --> 00:12:45,845
between you and Meng Tinghui?

219
00:12:46,065 --> 00:12:47,361
Tell the truth.

220
00:12:47,385 --> 00:12:48,845
Your Majesty,

221
00:12:49,305 --> 00:12:51,841
this humble man is originally from Shazhou.

222
00:12:51,865 --> 00:12:54,041
Because Lord Meng and
I are from the same place,

223
00:12:54,065 --> 00:12:56,681
I know she once lived
on the streets of Shazhou

224
00:12:56,705 --> 00:13:00,641
as a thieving, deceitful
beggar who committed every evil.

225
00:13:00,665 --> 00:13:03,001
She once poisoned someone

226
00:13:03,025 --> 00:13:04,885
just to steal half a string of coins.

227
00:13:05,185 --> 00:13:07,681
She often gathered other young beggars

228
00:13:07,705 --> 00:13:10,765
to prey on passing merchants.

229
00:13:11,985 --> 00:13:13,485
Lord Meng,

230
00:13:13,985 --> 00:13:15,401
it has been ten years.

231
00:13:15,425 --> 00:13:17,921
Had you not rushed out to kill me,

232
00:13:17,945 --> 00:13:19,961
I never would have recognized you as

233
00:13:19,985 --> 00:13:23,045
the little beggar who once stole my silver.

234
00:13:29,025 --> 00:13:30,281
Do you think changing your name

235
00:13:30,305 --> 00:13:32,085
can erase your sins?

236
00:13:32,585 --> 00:13:34,001
Ten years ago,

237
00:13:34,025 --> 00:13:35,281
you made your living trafficking children.

238
00:13:35,305 --> 00:13:37,801
You forced them to steal
and beg for your profit.

239
00:13:37,825 --> 00:13:40,001
If they resisted,
you broke their hands and feet.

240
00:13:40,025 --> 00:13:41,761
You raped young girls.

241
00:13:41,785 --> 00:13:43,161
Then sold them into slavery.

242
00:13:43,185 --> 00:13:45,081
My elder sister, A-Xiang,

243
00:13:45,105 --> 00:13:46,645
died at your hands.

244
00:13:49,905 --> 00:13:51,561
Changing your name means nothing.

245
00:13:51,585 --> 00:13:54,165
Even if you were reduced to ashes,

246
00:13:54,585 --> 00:13:55,725
I...

247
00:13:58,745 --> 00:14:00,485
would still recognize you.

248
00:14:03,985 --> 00:14:04,881
Lord Meng,

249
00:14:04,905 --> 00:14:07,161
do you have evidence?

250
00:14:07,185 --> 00:14:09,441
Does wearing those official robes

251
00:14:09,465 --> 00:14:11,321
give you the right to accuse someone

252
00:14:11,345 --> 00:14:12,845
with nothing but your own words?

253
00:14:13,425 --> 00:14:14,565
I know

254
00:14:14,985 --> 00:14:17,805
I'm only a humble commoner.

255
00:14:18,025 --> 00:14:20,121
My words carry little weight.

256
00:14:20,145 --> 00:14:24,005
I am certainly not some Master Wen.

257
00:14:24,425 --> 00:14:28,885
I beg Your Majesty to investigate clearly.

258
00:14:29,425 --> 00:14:31,685
I am the evidence.

259
00:14:33,265 --> 00:14:35,361
I was one of the children
you trafficked back then.

260
00:14:35,385 --> 00:14:37,285
That leg of yours

261
00:14:38,505 --> 00:14:40,405
was crippled by me.

262
00:14:42,505 --> 00:14:44,041
How dare you, Meng Tinghui!

263
00:14:44,065 --> 00:14:45,601
You oppress a commoner
in the imperial court.

264
00:14:45,625 --> 00:14:47,481
What regard have you for
His Majesty and the assembled officials?

265
00:14:47,505 --> 00:14:48,925
Murder!

266
00:14:51,345 --> 00:14:52,485
Lord Meng!

267
00:14:57,745 --> 00:14:59,165
Your Majesty,

268
00:14:59,585 --> 00:15:02,401
her claims grow more absurd by the moment.

269
00:15:02,425 --> 00:15:04,401
This humble man's leg

270
00:15:04,425 --> 00:15:07,201
was injured in an accident

271
00:15:07,225 --> 00:15:08,521
while unloading goods in Shazhou.

272
00:15:08,545 --> 00:15:12,085
That is why I came to the capital
to make a living, Your Majesty.

273
00:15:13,225 --> 00:15:14,801
Lord Meng,

274
00:15:14,825 --> 00:15:16,241
how can you frame me so casually?

275
00:15:16,265 --> 00:15:17,241
You human trafficker!

276
00:15:17,265 --> 00:15:19,801
You distort the truth
and accuse me instead.

277
00:15:19,825 --> 00:15:22,281
I regret not stabbing
you to death back then.

278
00:15:22,305 --> 00:15:23,645
Meng Tinghui,

279
00:15:25,985 --> 00:15:28,125
do you have any witness
or physical evidence

280
00:15:28,505 --> 00:15:31,405
proving he is the trafficker
you call Master Wen?

281
00:15:32,145 --> 00:15:33,285
I...

282
00:15:35,425 --> 00:15:36,565
do not.

283
00:15:41,025 --> 00:15:42,121
Your Majesty,

284
00:15:42,145 --> 00:15:43,721
I stake my life on this.

285
00:15:43,745 --> 00:15:46,081
Every word I said is true.

286
00:15:46,105 --> 00:15:48,445
He deliberately appeared
to lure me into a trap.

287
00:15:48,705 --> 00:15:50,925
I beg Your Majesty to
investigate thoroughly.

288
00:15:51,345 --> 00:15:53,401
Your Majesty,

289
00:15:53,425 --> 00:15:55,445
why would an old cripple like me

290
00:15:55,665 --> 00:15:58,045
put on such an elaborate act

291
00:15:58,865 --> 00:16:01,281
just to frame her?

292
00:16:01,305 --> 00:16:03,001
People often say

293
00:16:03,025 --> 00:16:05,281
officials protect one another.

294
00:16:05,305 --> 00:16:08,085
If you intend to shield her,

295
00:16:08,505 --> 00:16:10,485
what can a mere commoner like me

296
00:16:11,225 --> 00:16:13,965
possibly do against you?

297
00:16:14,625 --> 00:16:15,805
Your Majesty,

298
00:16:16,185 --> 00:16:18,201
since Meng Tinghui cannot produce evidence,

299
00:16:18,225 --> 00:16:19,841
I respectfully request that Your Majesty

300
00:16:19,865 --> 00:16:21,721
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence,

301
00:16:21,745 --> 00:16:24,321
immediately imprison Meng Tinghui,

302
00:16:24,345 --> 00:16:27,325
strip her of office, and investigate
her to uphold court discipline.

303
00:16:28,185 --> 00:16:29,521
Your Majesty,

304
00:16:29,545 --> 00:16:31,925
I know Your Majesty values
and cherishes talent.

305
00:16:32,585 --> 00:16:34,081
However, Meng Tinghui's actions this time

306
00:16:34,105 --> 00:16:36,521
have violated the law and
caused grave consequences.

307
00:16:36,545 --> 00:16:37,961
If this matter is mishandled

308
00:16:37,985 --> 00:16:40,081
and word spreads that
the court shields officials

309
00:16:40,105 --> 00:16:41,601
who kill innocent commoners,

310
00:16:41,625 --> 00:16:43,321
the court's authority may be damaged

311
00:16:43,345 --> 00:16:45,285
and the foundations of the realm shaken.

312
00:16:45,545 --> 00:16:48,205
I also respectfully
request that Your Majesty

313
00:16:48,385 --> 00:16:49,521
act according to the law,

314
00:16:49,545 --> 00:16:51,121
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence,

315
00:16:51,145 --> 00:16:52,561
severely punish Meng Tinghui,

316
00:16:52,585 --> 00:16:53,725
and reassure the realm.

317
00:16:54,505 --> 00:16:56,601
I second the motion.

318
00:16:56,625 --> 00:16:58,601
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

319
00:16:58,625 --> 00:17:00,805
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

320
00:17:32,025 --> 00:17:33,605
Raise your head and look.

321
00:17:36,225 --> 00:17:38,085
Do you recognize this dagger?

322
00:17:38,465 --> 00:17:39,761
This humble man does not.

323
00:17:39,785 --> 00:17:41,961
Then I shall help you remember.

324
00:17:41,985 --> 00:17:43,725
Left Chancellor, do you recall

325
00:17:44,025 --> 00:17:45,721
where I was ten years ago?

326
00:17:45,745 --> 00:17:47,245
Your Majesty,

327
00:17:47,625 --> 00:17:50,081
ten years ago, Your Majesty was fourteen

328
00:17:50,105 --> 00:17:53,201
and first toured the realm
on behalf of the late emperor.

329
00:17:53,225 --> 00:17:54,601
You personally went to the
frontier prefecture of Shazhou

330
00:17:54,625 --> 00:17:57,485
and destroyed a local
human-trafficking ring.

331
00:18:13,505 --> 00:18:15,765
The young man who saved me back then

332
00:18:15,945 --> 00:18:17,921
was actually you?

333
00:18:17,945 --> 00:18:19,001
Could Your Majesty be...?

334
00:18:19,025 --> 00:18:20,685
That's right.

335
00:18:21,025 --> 00:18:22,725
It was I.

336
00:18:39,665 --> 00:18:41,641
Meng Tinghui used this very dagger

337
00:18:41,665 --> 00:18:43,405
to wound your leg.

338
00:18:58,025 --> 00:19:00,441
I witnessed everything
you did with my own eyes.

339
00:19:00,465 --> 00:19:02,005
Are you saying...

340
00:19:02,185 --> 00:19:03,685
that I am falsely accusing you?

341
00:19:05,225 --> 00:19:06,561
You wanted evidence, did you not?

342
00:19:06,585 --> 00:19:09,241
Meng Tinghui has none, but I do.

343
00:19:09,265 --> 00:19:10,801
I am the witness.

344
00:19:10,825 --> 00:19:12,201
And this dagger

345
00:19:12,225 --> 00:19:13,765
is the physical evidence.

346
00:19:14,185 --> 00:19:15,761
Its triangular blade

347
00:19:15,785 --> 00:19:17,001
is unique.

348
00:19:17,025 --> 00:19:18,761
It matches the wound on your body.

349
00:19:18,785 --> 00:19:21,645
Must I personally examine
your injury to prove it?

350
00:19:22,625 --> 00:19:24,841
If Your Majesty closes the case so hastily

351
00:19:24,865 --> 00:19:26,441
and shows favoritism toward Meng Tinghui,

352
00:19:26,465 --> 00:19:28,201
the people will say

353
00:19:28,225 --> 00:19:29,801
that any official who
wins Your Majesty's favor

354
00:19:29,825 --> 00:19:32,321
may kill at will.

355
00:19:32,345 --> 00:19:33,485
Such a decision

356
00:19:33,745 --> 00:19:35,961
will chill the hearts of all commoners.

357
00:19:35,985 --> 00:19:37,765
Di Nian.

358
00:19:39,705 --> 00:19:41,125
Bring in the witness.

359
00:19:55,545 --> 00:19:56,961
The condemned slave, Heiying,

360
00:19:56,985 --> 00:19:58,205
pays his respects to Your Majesty.

361
00:20:01,985 --> 00:20:03,161
Ten years ago,

362
00:20:03,185 --> 00:20:05,365
I helped Master Wen escape from Shazhou.

363
00:20:06,265 --> 00:20:08,961
At the time, he trafficked children,

364
00:20:08,985 --> 00:20:10,481
forcing them to steal.

365
00:20:10,505 --> 00:20:13,041
Those who refused were tortured,
killed, and buried.

366
00:20:13,065 --> 00:20:15,161
This condemned slave was
once Master Wen's trusted subordinate.

367
00:20:15,185 --> 00:20:17,285
I abducted thirty-nine children for him.

368
00:20:17,865 --> 00:20:19,561
Lord Meng and her sworn sister

369
00:20:19,585 --> 00:20:21,561
attempted to escape many times.

370
00:20:21,585 --> 00:20:23,041
I was always ordered to bring them back.

371
00:20:23,065 --> 00:20:24,601
I personally saw Master Wen in Shazhou

372
00:20:24,625 --> 00:20:26,681
forge the identity of
a law-abiding citizen.

373
00:20:26,705 --> 00:20:27,761
Now he has changed his name again

374
00:20:27,785 --> 00:20:29,441
and hidden in the capital.

375
00:20:29,465 --> 00:20:31,241
We have had no contact for ten years.

376
00:20:31,265 --> 00:20:33,521
Master Wen still bears
an arrow wound on his chest,

377
00:20:33,545 --> 00:20:36,161
inflicted when Your Majesty toured Shazhou.

378
00:20:36,185 --> 00:20:38,925
This man is unquestionably Master Wen.

379
00:20:43,105 --> 00:20:45,241
You hid under a false
identity in the capital for years,

380
00:20:45,265 --> 00:20:47,561
then suddenly appeared
to provoke her into violence.

381
00:20:47,585 --> 00:20:49,605
None of this can be a coincidence.

382
00:20:51,705 --> 00:20:52,965
Speak.

383
00:20:53,625 --> 00:20:55,641
Who ordered you

384
00:20:55,665 --> 00:20:57,565
to frame Meng Tinghui?

385
00:20:57,945 --> 00:20:59,881
Spare me, Your Majesty!

386
00:20:59,905 --> 00:21:01,721
Please spare me!

387
00:21:01,745 --> 00:21:03,481
I hated Meng Tinghui

388
00:21:03,505 --> 00:21:05,121
for crippling me back then.

389
00:21:05,145 --> 00:21:07,441
That is why I agreed to help
the leader of the Tiger Roar Gang

390
00:21:07,465 --> 00:21:09,485
get rid of her.

391
00:21:13,985 --> 00:21:15,885
The Tiger Roar Gang.

392
00:21:16,105 --> 00:21:17,965
My ministers,

393
00:21:18,145 --> 00:21:21,081
the Tiger Roar Gang plotted to
frame an imperial official.

394
00:21:21,105 --> 00:21:22,805
The truth has now been revealed.

395
00:21:23,185 --> 00:21:24,641
Do you still demand that I
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence

396
00:21:24,665 --> 00:21:26,325
and severely punish Meng Tinghui?

397
00:21:34,305 --> 00:21:35,845
Study.

398
00:21:36,225 --> 00:21:37,521
Pass the imperial examination.

399
00:21:37,545 --> 00:21:39,441
Enter the court as an official.

400
00:21:39,465 --> 00:21:41,801
How can I become as powerful as you?

401
00:21:41,825 --> 00:21:44,681
Study, pass the imperial examination,

402
00:21:44,705 --> 00:21:45,925
and enter the court as an official.

403
00:21:46,545 --> 00:21:48,645
Once authority is in your hands,

404
00:21:48,985 --> 00:21:50,845
everything will be different.

405
00:21:51,065 --> 00:21:53,125
You truly accomplished it all.

406
00:21:55,505 --> 00:21:57,721
Step by step,

407
00:21:57,745 --> 00:21:59,405
you truly made your way before me.

408
00:22:38,465 --> 00:22:40,841
As an imperial official, Meng Tinghui

409
00:22:40,865 --> 00:22:43,321
should be severely punished
for privately assaulting someone.

410
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:46,321
However, considering the cruel
abuse you suffered at his hands

411
00:22:46,345 --> 00:22:48,605
and the misery of your circumstances,
your actions are understandable.

412
00:22:48,945 --> 00:22:50,441
You are therefore fined
three months' salary.

413
00:22:50,465 --> 00:22:52,605
Take this as a lesson in the future.

414
00:22:52,985 --> 00:22:55,165
Do not let hatred blind you.

415
00:22:58,465 --> 00:23:00,765
Thank you for Your Majesty's mercy.

416
00:23:02,145 --> 00:23:04,165
I will remember your instruction

417
00:23:05,145 --> 00:23:06,445
and never betray Your Majesty's grace.

418
00:23:07,785 --> 00:23:10,121
You trafficked children,
murdered innocents,

419
00:23:10,145 --> 00:23:12,161
and framed an imperial official.

420
00:23:12,185 --> 00:23:14,361
Under the Great Ning Code,
your crimes shall be punished together.

421
00:23:14,385 --> 00:23:15,965
You are sentenced to death by beheading.

422
00:23:19,545 --> 00:23:21,321
Spare me, Your Majesty!

423
00:23:21,345 --> 00:23:22,641
Lord Meng!

424
00:23:22,665 --> 00:23:24,201
Please spare me!

425
00:23:24,225 --> 00:23:25,441
Your Majesty,

426
00:23:25,465 --> 00:23:28,281
even if these men's crimes are unforgivable

427
00:23:28,305 --> 00:23:30,241
and the Tiger Roar Gang deserves execution,

428
00:23:30,265 --> 00:23:31,601
Your Majesty has still

429
00:23:31,625 --> 00:23:33,361
placed the Bureau of
Intelligence in the hands

430
00:23:33,385 --> 00:23:35,121
of a deceitful beggar
with a disgraceful past.

431
00:23:35,145 --> 00:23:36,361
How can the people accept her authority?

432
00:23:36,385 --> 00:23:37,961
This will never command respect.

433
00:23:37,985 --> 00:23:38,881
Left Chancellor,

434
00:23:38,905 --> 00:23:41,481
can a beggar not study
and enter official service?

435
00:23:41,505 --> 00:23:42,681
Everything I did in the past

436
00:23:42,705 --> 00:23:45,041
was forced upon me by Master Wen.

437
00:23:45,065 --> 00:23:46,841
I studied diligently and earned
distinction in the examinations,

438
00:23:46,865 --> 00:23:48,801
advancing step by step
to where I stand today.

439
00:23:48,825 --> 00:23:50,485
If I am unqualified,

440
00:23:51,625 --> 00:23:54,041
is Ding Chong, who treated
human life as worthless, qualified?

441
00:23:54,065 --> 00:23:56,481
Is Wan Kai, who sheltered
the Tiger Roar Gang, qualified?

442
00:23:56,505 --> 00:23:57,601
Or in the gambling-house case,

443
00:23:57,625 --> 00:23:59,681
were Vice Minister Zheng
and the others who were arrested

444
00:23:59,705 --> 00:24:01,201
qualified?

445
00:24:01,225 --> 00:24:02,841
I nearly forgot.

446
00:24:02,865 --> 00:24:05,281
They were all your prized disciples,
Left Chancellor.

447
00:24:05,305 --> 00:24:08,121
-How dare you!
-As imperial officials,

448
00:24:08,145 --> 00:24:09,921
you failed to judge men properly

449
00:24:09,945 --> 00:24:11,965
and nearly became the
Tiger Roar Gang's claws and fangs.

450
00:24:12,545 --> 00:24:14,201
After this matter,

451
00:24:14,225 --> 00:24:16,725
all of you should return
home and reflect carefully

452
00:24:16,985 --> 00:24:19,205
on what it truly means
to serve as a minister.

453
00:24:23,265 --> 00:24:24,445
What are we going to do?

454
00:24:24,945 --> 00:24:26,321
They've been questioning her all night,

455
00:24:26,345 --> 00:24:27,925
and she still hasn't been released.

456
00:24:29,385 --> 00:24:31,761
None of you know what
Master Wen did to her.

457
00:24:31,785 --> 00:24:34,445
That beast deserved to be
cut into a thousand pieces long ago.

458
00:24:34,745 --> 00:24:35,841
This is all my fault.

459
00:24:35,865 --> 00:24:37,921
Mengmeng worked so
hard to become an official.

460
00:24:37,945 --> 00:24:40,201
I should have noticed sooner
that something was troubling her

461
00:24:40,225 --> 00:24:41,881
and killed Master Wen for her.

462
00:24:41,905 --> 00:24:43,045
I...

463
00:24:47,225 --> 00:24:49,805
Don't panic. Let's wait a little longer.

464
00:25:01,585 --> 00:25:03,005
Where is she?

465
00:25:03,785 --> 00:25:05,881
Could His Majesty have thrown
Mengmeng into the imperial prison?

466
00:25:05,905 --> 00:25:07,161
Wait here and try not to worry.

467
00:25:07,185 --> 00:25:08,525
I'll find out what's happening.

468
00:25:10,785 --> 00:25:12,245
Mengmeng!

469
00:25:15,025 --> 00:25:16,685
Mengmeng!

470
00:25:17,305 --> 00:25:19,121
Thank heavens, you're finally out.

471
00:25:19,145 --> 00:25:20,521
What happened?

472
00:25:20,545 --> 00:25:21,925
Are you hurt?

473
00:25:22,825 --> 00:25:23,761
How did His Majesty rule

474
00:25:23,785 --> 00:25:25,081
on Master Wen's case?

475
00:25:25,105 --> 00:25:27,645
And did His Majesty punish you?

476
00:25:30,345 --> 00:25:31,485
Fu Zhi,

477
00:25:33,865 --> 00:25:36,485
I finally avenged Sister A-Xiang.

478
00:25:39,385 --> 00:25:40,645
Back then,

479
00:25:41,065 --> 00:25:43,285
I failed to kill him with my own hands.

480
00:25:46,185 --> 00:25:48,565
Now His Majesty has permitted
me to supervise his execution.

481
00:25:54,145 --> 00:25:55,285
I finally...

482
00:26:09,505 --> 00:26:10,765
finally...

483
00:26:15,185 --> 00:26:17,005
It's all over.

484
00:26:17,545 --> 00:26:19,325
Your nightmare is over too.

485
00:26:20,065 --> 00:26:21,765
From now on, I'll be by your side.

486
00:26:22,345 --> 00:26:23,561
Lord Meng,

487
00:26:23,585 --> 00:26:25,361
avenging such a deep wrong is a good thing.

488
00:26:25,385 --> 00:26:27,845
But did His Majesty become
angry with you over this?

489
00:26:28,585 --> 00:26:29,725
That's right.

490
00:26:30,545 --> 00:26:32,925
Do you remember the young man

491
00:26:33,465 --> 00:26:35,925
I told you saved me ten years ago?

492
00:26:37,065 --> 00:26:38,561
Of course.

493
00:26:38,585 --> 00:26:40,721
You even drew many portraits of him.

494
00:26:40,745 --> 00:26:42,401
He turned out to be His Majesty.

495
00:26:42,425 --> 00:26:44,125
His Majesty?

496
00:26:45,185 --> 00:26:47,245
All of this

497
00:26:49,305 --> 00:26:51,201
feels like a dream.

498
00:26:51,225 --> 00:26:53,201
I never imagined

499
00:26:53,225 --> 00:26:55,521
that over these ten years,

500
00:26:55,545 --> 00:26:57,641
His Majesty would become
even more handsome.

501
00:26:57,665 --> 00:26:59,841
You still have time to swoon over him?

502
00:26:59,865 --> 00:27:01,085
Then you must be fine.

503
00:27:01,825 --> 00:27:03,321
Young Lord Shen,

504
00:27:03,345 --> 00:27:04,241
why are you here?

505
00:27:04,265 --> 00:27:06,161
She insisted on rushing
over to find you yesterday.

506
00:27:06,185 --> 00:27:07,361
I feared her recklessness
would cause trouble,

507
00:27:07,385 --> 00:27:08,481
so I came with her.

508
00:27:08,505 --> 00:27:09,841
But now that I've seen you safe and sound,

509
00:27:09,865 --> 00:27:11,525
I can set out with peace of mind.

510
00:27:16,825 --> 00:27:19,201
Thank you, Young Lord Shen.
But rest assured,

511
00:27:19,225 --> 00:27:21,601
I will never fall for you

512
00:27:21,625 --> 00:27:24,205
-just because you eagerly helped me.
-You'd better not.

513
00:27:31,985 --> 00:27:33,605
Yan Fuzhi,

514
00:27:35,585 --> 00:27:37,125
go home.

515
00:27:57,225 --> 00:27:59,321
It is three quarters past noon.

516
00:27:59,345 --> 00:28:01,441
Carry out the execution.

517
00:28:01,465 --> 00:28:03,125
Behead him.

518
00:28:29,145 --> 00:28:30,285
Sister Tinghui.

519
00:28:37,825 --> 00:28:39,165
Sister A-Xiang.

520
00:28:46,385 --> 00:28:47,925
My dear Sister Tinghui,

521
00:28:48,345 --> 00:28:50,921
I saw everything you did for me.

522
00:28:50,945 --> 00:28:52,165
You've suffered so much.

523
00:28:56,065 --> 00:28:57,681
Sister A-Xiang,

524
00:28:57,705 --> 00:29:00,845
in the end, I still couldn't save you.

525
00:29:02,105 --> 00:29:03,525
I'm sorry.

526
00:29:03,905 --> 00:29:05,521
I never regretted

527
00:29:05,545 --> 00:29:07,285
saving you that day.

528
00:29:07,865 --> 00:29:09,161
Now,

529
00:29:09,185 --> 00:29:10,725
seeing the person you've become

530
00:29:11,705 --> 00:29:13,245
brings me even greater comfort.

531
00:29:27,345 --> 00:29:28,641
Let go

532
00:29:28,665 --> 00:29:30,045
of the knot in your heart.

533
00:29:30,585 --> 00:29:31,801
From now on,

534
00:29:31,825 --> 00:29:34,165
you must see all the beautiful
sights in this world

535
00:29:35,385 --> 00:29:36,845
on my behalf.

536
00:30:27,905 --> 00:30:29,605
Sister A-Xiang.

537
00:30:36,265 --> 00:30:38,365
Sister A-Xiang!

538
00:31:34,905 --> 00:31:36,321
I heard

539
00:31:36,345 --> 00:31:39,365
one was a young emperor
traveling incognito,

540
00:31:39,825 --> 00:31:42,841
while the other was a lonely
orphan surviving in the streets.

541
00:31:42,865 --> 00:31:45,641
Heaven tied a red thread between them

542
00:31:45,665 --> 00:31:47,561
and brought together two people

543
00:31:47,585 --> 00:31:48,641
as different as clouds and mud.

544
00:31:48,665 --> 00:31:50,001
Tell me,

545
00:31:50,025 --> 00:31:51,881
isn't that more exciting than a storybook?

546
00:31:51,905 --> 00:31:53,001
It certainly is.

547
00:31:53,025 --> 00:31:54,441
Fate truly is

548
00:31:54,465 --> 00:31:56,565
impossible to explain.

549
00:31:56,945 --> 00:31:59,245
I would love to see her beauty for myself.

550
00:31:59,545 --> 00:32:01,361
Unfortunately, Bofeng House

551
00:32:01,385 --> 00:32:02,281
-won't open its doors.
-Here.

552
00:32:02,305 --> 00:32:04,401
-I came early this morning.
-Make way, please.

553
00:32:04,425 --> 00:32:06,081
-Here, Shopkeeper.
-There are many things in this world

554
00:32:06,105 --> 00:32:07,561
that are impossible to explain.

555
00:32:07,585 --> 00:32:09,361
Far too many.

556
00:32:09,385 --> 00:32:10,721
Some people

557
00:32:10,745 --> 00:32:12,041
have no respect for the law.

558
00:32:12,065 --> 00:32:14,081
She actually dared kill
someone in the street.

559
00:32:14,105 --> 00:32:15,961
Tell me, how is that any different

560
00:32:15,985 --> 00:32:17,681
from a common butcher?

561
00:32:17,705 --> 00:32:20,161
She's merely relying on imperial favor.

562
00:32:20,185 --> 00:32:22,645
What genuine ability does she have?

563
00:32:23,065 --> 00:32:25,441
Shopkeeper, when those noble ladies

564
00:32:25,465 --> 00:32:27,041
came to Spring House for tea the other day,

565
00:32:27,065 --> 00:32:29,161
didn't you have a delightful
conversation with them?

566
00:32:29,185 --> 00:32:31,281
You must know the inside story, don't you?

567
00:32:31,305 --> 00:32:32,641
-Inside story?
-There's more to it?

568
00:32:32,665 --> 00:32:34,241
Shopkeeper Yu, tell us.

569
00:32:34,265 --> 00:32:36,921
Those noble young ladies are all saying

570
00:32:36,945 --> 00:32:39,201
that Meng Tinghui is Daji reincarnated.

571
00:32:39,225 --> 00:32:40,401
-Daji?
-Daji reincarnated?

572
00:32:40,425 --> 00:32:43,045
She has bewitched the emperor.

573
00:32:43,665 --> 00:32:45,801
-Shopkeeper, are you all right?
-Yan Fuzhi!

574
00:32:45,825 --> 00:32:47,445
How dare you splash water on me?

575
00:32:49,585 --> 00:32:51,841
Listen carefully. Say one more
bad word about Mengmeng,

576
00:32:51,865 --> 00:32:53,801
and I'll smash your Spring House to pieces.

577
00:32:53,825 --> 00:32:55,521
And if you keep spreading
gossip behind her back,

578
00:32:55,545 --> 00:32:57,121
aren't you afraid His Majesty
will cut off your head?

579
00:32:57,145 --> 00:32:58,361
-I...
-Come on, then!

580
00:32:58,385 --> 00:33:00,241
-Come on!
-Just you wait!

581
00:33:00,265 --> 00:33:01,405
Let's go.

582
00:33:02,225 --> 00:33:04,001
How could Teacher say such a thing?

583
00:33:04,025 --> 00:33:05,321
Father,

584
00:33:05,345 --> 00:33:06,361
you weren't at court.

585
00:33:06,385 --> 00:33:07,761
The report must be mistaken.

586
00:33:07,785 --> 00:33:08,965
Father,

587
00:33:09,665 --> 00:33:10,965
if you don't believe me,

588
00:33:11,825 --> 00:33:13,525
then listen to A-Nian.

589
00:33:16,705 --> 00:33:17,961
Sister Zhili,

590
00:33:17,985 --> 00:33:19,321
I witnessed it with my
own eyes in the great hall.

591
00:33:19,345 --> 00:33:21,761
The Right Chancellor indeed declared...

592
00:33:21,785 --> 00:33:23,565
his support for abolishing
the Bureau of Intelligence

593
00:33:23,985 --> 00:33:25,441
and severely punishing Lord Meng.

594
00:33:25,465 --> 00:33:27,841
Teacher has always supported
women taking the imperial examination

595
00:33:27,865 --> 00:33:29,961
and repeatedly spoke on Lord Meng's behalf.

596
00:33:29,985 --> 00:33:31,641
Why would he suddenly change his position

597
00:33:31,665 --> 00:33:33,405
-and contradict his own actions?
-Sister,

598
00:33:33,665 --> 00:33:35,801
the Right Chancellor appears
upright and honorable,

599
00:33:35,825 --> 00:33:37,161
but think carefully.

600
00:33:37,185 --> 00:33:39,121
Why have his actions in recent
years always pleased both sides?

601
00:33:39,145 --> 00:33:40,441
A-Nian,

602
00:33:40,465 --> 00:33:42,281
you only misunderstand Teacher

603
00:33:42,305 --> 00:33:44,481
-because you don't truly know him.
-A-Nian,

604
00:33:44,505 --> 00:33:45,441
go change your clothes

605
00:33:45,465 --> 00:33:46,925
and sit down to eat.

606
00:33:51,585 --> 00:33:52,481
Father,

607
00:33:52,505 --> 00:33:55,001
Teacher must have his
reasons for acting this way.

608
00:33:55,025 --> 00:33:55,921
I'll go ask him myself.

609
00:33:55,945 --> 00:33:57,485
Stop.

610
00:34:01,185 --> 00:34:03,121
I allowed you to study painting
under him back then

611
00:34:03,145 --> 00:34:06,085
because you loved the art
and had a natural gift.

612
00:34:07,865 --> 00:34:09,841
Now that you are grown,

613
00:34:09,865 --> 00:34:11,681
you must remember even more clearly

614
00:34:11,705 --> 00:34:14,481
that the bond between teacher
and student requires proper boundaries.

615
00:34:14,505 --> 00:34:16,845
Your conduct must remain measured.

616
00:34:17,105 --> 00:34:18,361
Father,

617
00:34:18,385 --> 00:34:20,001
I deeply respect Teacher.

618
00:34:20,025 --> 00:34:21,441
That is why I do not want
others to misunderstand him.

619
00:34:21,465 --> 00:34:23,165
Zhili,

620
00:34:26,825 --> 00:34:27,961
my child,

621
00:34:27,985 --> 00:34:29,001
within the court,

622
00:34:29,025 --> 00:34:31,161
the human heart is an unfathomable abyss.

623
00:34:31,185 --> 00:34:33,761
Many matters are not simply black or white.

624
00:34:33,785 --> 00:34:36,681
Whether you question him
today and whether he answers

625
00:34:36,705 --> 00:34:38,285
will make no difference.

626
00:34:38,705 --> 00:34:41,241
What you have seen is
merely the tip of the iceberg.

627
00:34:41,265 --> 00:34:43,761
Only by stepping outside the game

628
00:34:43,785 --> 00:34:46,325
can you glimpse the whole picture.

629
00:34:51,185 --> 00:34:52,405
Come and eat.

630
00:35:08,825 --> 00:35:09,965
Thank you, Father.

631
00:35:46,185 --> 00:35:47,641
Lord Meng,

632
00:35:47,665 --> 00:35:49,005
please

633
00:35:49,305 --> 00:35:50,885
accept all of these.

634
00:35:51,145 --> 00:35:52,561
Aren't these things

635
00:35:52,585 --> 00:35:54,445
your usual favorites?

636
00:35:54,745 --> 00:35:56,201
I never knew

637
00:35:56,225 --> 00:35:58,125
you suffered so much as a child.

638
00:35:58,385 --> 00:35:59,681
I thought the matter with Jiang Mei'er

639
00:35:59,705 --> 00:36:01,361
had already caused you enough injustice.

640
00:36:01,385 --> 00:36:03,725
I never imagined Master Wen was so vicious.

641
00:36:03,985 --> 00:36:05,761
You wandered from place
to place since childhood,

642
00:36:05,785 --> 00:36:07,801
yet still ranked first in
all three examinations.

643
00:36:07,825 --> 00:36:09,805
I truly admire you beyond words.

644
00:36:11,305 --> 00:36:13,965
I do not know how to express what I feel.

645
00:36:16,265 --> 00:36:18,005
I only hope these gifts

646
00:36:19,065 --> 00:36:21,325
can bring some warmth
to your once-cold past.

647
00:36:27,705 --> 00:36:28,845
Zhili,

648
00:36:29,425 --> 00:36:31,245
why are your eyes turning red?

649
00:36:32,025 --> 00:36:33,321
It is all in the past.

650
00:36:33,345 --> 00:36:35,045
Everything ahead will be new.

651
00:36:50,265 --> 00:36:51,841
Lord Meng,

652
00:36:51,865 --> 00:36:53,681
you were so young,

653
00:36:53,705 --> 00:36:55,085
with no one to rely on,

654
00:36:55,385 --> 00:36:57,445
yet you had to face

655
00:36:58,665 --> 00:37:00,281
the blades of human traffickers alone.

656
00:37:00,305 --> 00:37:02,525
How did you endure it?

657
00:37:03,585 --> 00:37:05,445
If your family knew,

658
00:37:07,345 --> 00:37:08,645
their hearts would ache terribly.

659
00:37:09,185 --> 00:37:10,645
For as long as I can remember,

660
00:37:12,545 --> 00:37:14,125
I wandered the streets.

661
00:37:14,825 --> 00:37:15,965
I became used to it.

662
00:37:16,665 --> 00:37:18,925
Simply surviving was already great fortune.

663
00:37:20,385 --> 00:37:21,605
This is all my fault.

664
00:37:22,985 --> 00:37:24,885
Had I met you sooner,

665
00:37:25,985 --> 00:37:27,765
I would have risked my life

666
00:37:28,705 --> 00:37:30,485
rather than let you
suffer in the slightest.

667
00:37:35,265 --> 00:37:36,921
After surviving a great calamity...

668
00:37:36,945 --> 00:37:38,365
-good fortune is sure to follow.
-Good fortune is sure to follow.

669
00:37:40,785 --> 00:37:42,161
Am I not perfectly well now?

670
00:37:42,185 --> 00:37:44,445
My lord, from this day forward,

671
00:37:44,985 --> 00:37:46,245
on every road you must walk,

672
00:37:46,665 --> 00:37:47,561
I will go first.

673
00:37:47,585 --> 00:37:49,085
Anyone you wish to kill,

674
00:37:49,625 --> 00:37:50,921
-I will strike first...
-Enough.

675
00:37:50,945 --> 00:37:53,521
I know both of you mean well.

676
00:37:53,545 --> 00:37:56,561
Master Wen acted under
orders from the Tiger Roar Gang.

677
00:37:56,585 --> 00:37:58,205
Ling Yunfei,

678
00:37:58,865 --> 00:38:00,521
after targeting me again and again,

679
00:38:00,545 --> 00:38:02,561
will never stop here.

680
00:38:02,585 --> 00:38:03,801
We must act quickly.

681
00:38:03,825 --> 00:38:05,725
Ling Yunfei,

682
00:38:07,065 --> 00:38:09,085
this time, we will settle

683
00:38:09,945 --> 00:38:10,881
both old and new scores together.

684
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:13,241
Master Wen was remarkably tight-lipped.

685
00:38:13,265 --> 00:38:14,921
He admitted only that the
Tiger Roar Gang ordered him,

686
00:38:14,945 --> 00:38:18,005
but refused to reveal their
stronghold no matter what.

687
00:38:18,665 --> 00:38:20,561
Where exactly

688
00:38:20,585 --> 00:38:21,841
is the Tiger Roar Gang's lair?

689
00:38:21,865 --> 00:38:24,565
The Tiger Roar Gang is
not what it once was.

690
00:38:25,425 --> 00:38:27,285
It is no longer hidden so deeply.

691
00:38:29,425 --> 00:38:30,565
I...

692
00:38:31,345 --> 00:38:32,721
have something to attend to today

693
00:38:32,745 --> 00:38:33,921
and must leave first.

694
00:38:33,945 --> 00:38:35,605
-Where are you going?
-Where are you headed?

695
00:38:36,305 --> 00:38:38,005
To meet an old acquaintance.

696
00:39:01,705 --> 00:39:03,645
Your Majesty recognized me long ago.

697
00:39:03,985 --> 00:39:05,485
Why did you wait so long to say it?

698
00:39:05,865 --> 00:39:07,285
I was wondering

699
00:39:08,185 --> 00:39:10,125
whether you had already forgotten me.

700
00:39:23,185 --> 00:39:25,205
You didn't draw this, did you?

701
00:39:25,665 --> 00:39:28,681
I thought that if one day

702
00:39:28,705 --> 00:39:30,925
I ever met that young man again,

703
00:39:31,825 --> 00:39:33,565
I would give it to him myself

704
00:39:35,345 --> 00:39:37,045
and thank him for saving me back then.

705
00:39:37,825 --> 00:39:39,645
So in your heart,

706
00:39:40,905 --> 00:39:42,525
I was this handsome in those days.

707
00:39:49,545 --> 00:39:50,965
Young man.

708
00:39:53,225 --> 00:39:54,365
He Du.

709
00:39:54,985 --> 00:39:56,165
Your Majesty.

710
00:39:57,425 --> 00:39:59,925
Over these ten years,
under different identities,

711
00:40:00,185 --> 00:40:02,125
you have witnessed the course of my life.

712
00:40:20,225 --> 00:40:21,685
Sister A-Xiang, hurry and eat.

713
00:40:39,025 --> 00:40:40,845
Thank you.

714
00:40:48,665 --> 00:40:51,481
I was still young then
and handled matters poorly.

715
00:40:51,505 --> 00:40:53,645
I failed to arrange a proper home for you.

716
00:40:54,185 --> 00:40:56,165
That was my fault.

717
00:40:58,625 --> 00:41:00,885
Your Majesty has already helped me greatly.

718
00:41:01,425 --> 00:41:02,921
I am doing very well now.

719
00:41:02,945 --> 00:41:04,365
You are doing well.

720
00:41:04,945 --> 00:41:07,005
But I believe you can do even better.

721
00:41:07,545 --> 00:41:09,685
I also believe you can
eradicate the Tiger Roar Gang

722
00:41:10,025 --> 00:41:11,485
and restore integrity to the court.

723
00:41:11,985 --> 00:41:13,441
I also believe Your Majesty

724
00:41:13,465 --> 00:41:15,285
is Great Ning's enlightened ruler

725
00:41:15,905 --> 00:41:18,005
and will surely usher in
an age of prosperity.

726
00:41:30,545 --> 00:41:31,685
Excellent wine.

727
00:41:36,945 --> 00:41:38,761
As the ruler of a nation,

728
00:41:38,785 --> 00:41:39,841
I am revered by all the people

729
00:41:39,865 --> 00:41:41,521
and worshiped by every official.

730
00:41:41,545 --> 00:41:42,601
They stand in awe of me,

731
00:41:42,625 --> 00:41:44,281
fear me, and scheme against me.

732
00:41:44,305 --> 00:41:45,725
Only you

733
00:41:46,785 --> 00:41:48,525
dare challenge me

734
00:41:49,265 --> 00:41:51,685
and also drink with me
and speak from the heart.

735
00:41:56,985 --> 00:41:58,401
You and I...

736
00:41:58,425 --> 00:42:00,005
Are we truly speaking from the heart?

737
00:42:01,625 --> 00:42:03,205
Are we not?

